Its range extends into packaging and labelling, personal printing, photographic products, and promotional events and gifting, alongside retail and exhibition displays and safety products such as signage required under workplace regulations. Trading Monday to Friday from 8am to 5pm and Saturdays from 9am to 1pm, Jetline Montana serves businesses and individuals across the Montana area needing anything from a single printed document to a full exhibition display produced locally.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'https://www.jetline.co.za/store/jetline-montana/'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'jetline-montana-montana-gardens' AND description = 'Jetline Montana is a printing and graphic design store at Montana Crossing Shopping Centre, offering full-colour and black & white printing, corporate stationery, document duplication and binding, banners, signage, vehicle branding and website design.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
